{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00420",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 7.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I brought my bag, is it fine to leave it here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.36,
      "end_seconds": 13.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Alright, no trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 15.1,
      "end_seconds": 21.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.41,
      "end_seconds": 28.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "I'm here because of a mole on my back that looks different."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.57,
      "end_seconds": 32.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "How far back does it go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.11,
      "end_seconds": 35.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "About... well, about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.4,
      "end_seconds": 41.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "What about another new spot on your arm, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.7,
      "end_seconds": 63.83,
      "duration_seconds": 21.13,
      "text": "Yes, I have. I've also had a bit of itching on it, for four weeks. Um, as for bit of itching on it, it's a few times a day. It bled once was there, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.83,
      "end_seconds": 69.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.04,
      "end_seconds": 82.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.34,
      "text": "Heart disease, for five years. I've had heart failure for about a year now. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.33,
      "end_seconds": 84.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.58,
      "end_seconds": 88.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.86,
      "end_seconds": 97.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Right, so heart failure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.25,
      "end_seconds": 116.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Any sport or activity?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.52,
      "end_seconds": 120.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I play badminton on Sundays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.23,
      "end_seconds": 122.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "What's your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.92,
      "end_seconds": 126.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "I teach at a primary school."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.33,
      "end_seconds": 132.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.89,
      "end_seconds": 137.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I take aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 139.29,
      "end_seconds": 147.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "It's meant to be once a day, though I don't see he take it every time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.51,
      "end_seconds": 154.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "I take furosemide, 40 milligrams, every morning for the fluid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.15,
      "end_seconds": 160.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Is that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.17,
      "end_seconds": 166.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "About two months. It's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.65,
      "end_seconds": 177.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Before I prescribe anything, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.36,
      "end_seconds": 179.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Ibuprofen, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.09,
      "end_seconds": 186.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Did you get pain, weight loss, fever or history of skin cancer?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.77,
      "end_seconds": 193.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "No, no pain, weight loss, fever or history of skin cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.27,
      "end_seconds": 197.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Nothing like lumps in the armpit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.87,
      "end_seconds": 202.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "No. No lumps in the armpit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.78,
      "end_seconds": 205.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.06,
      "end_seconds": 209.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.59,
      "end_seconds": 215.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "First the numbers, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.09,
      "end_seconds": 228.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "One second..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.87,
      "end_seconds": 252.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 99 percent, temperature is 36.5 degrees, heart rate 74, respiratory rate 18, pressure 109 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.69,
      "end_seconds": 257.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.65,
      "end_seconds": 261.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Let's look at it together in a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.55,
      "end_seconds": 266.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Shall we do the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.93,
      "end_seconds": 268.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.51,
      "end_seconds": 272.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.74,
      "end_seconds": 290.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I can't feel any glands in the armpit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.33,
      "end_seconds": 292.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.0,
      "end_seconds": 295.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.45,
      "end_seconds": 313.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "It's about eight millimetres, with an uneven border and two shades of brown."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.46,
      "end_seconds": 320.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "All done, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.82,
      "end_seconds": 346.3,
      "duration_seconds": 13.48,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at a pigmented lesion that needs to be looked at more closely or a seborrhoeic keratosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.28,
      "end_seconds": 353.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.92,
      "end_seconds": 389.32,
      "duration_seconds": 33.4,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a pigmented lesion that needs to be looked at more closely is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book a dermoscopy to look into changing mole. I'm going to order a skin biopsy, for changing mole. Please use sunscreen and cover up in the midday sun, and check your skin once a month. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.93,
      "end_seconds": 393.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "I'll want another look after the biopsy results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.77,
      "end_seconds": 395.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.53,
      "end_seconds": 400.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 402.29,
      "end_seconds": 404.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, thanks."
    }
  ]
}